            "sid": "MAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The burden of the word of Jehovah to Israel by Malachi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have loved you, saith Jehovah. Yet ye say, Wherein hast thou loved us? Was not Esau Jacob’s brother? saith Jehovah: yet I loved Jacob; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but Esau I hated, and made his mountains a desolation, and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " his heritage to the jackals of the wilderness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whereas Edom saith, We are beaten down, but we will return and build the waste places; thus saith Jehovah of hosts, They shall build, but I will throw down; and men shall call them The border of wickedness, and The people against whom Jehovah hath indignation for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And your eyes shall see, and ye shall say, Jehovah be magnified beyond the border of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A son honoreth his father, and a servant his master: if then I am a father, where is mine honor? and if I am a master, where is my fear? saith Jehovah of hosts unto you, O priests, that despise my name. And ye say, Wherein have we despised thy name? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye offer polluted bread upon mine altar. And ye say, Wherein have we polluted thee? In that ye say, The table of Jehovah is contemptible. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when ye offer the blind for sacrifice, it is no evil! and when ye offer the lame and sick, it is no evil! Present it now unto thy governor; will he be pleased with thee? or will he accept thy person? saith Jehovah of hosts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now, I pray you, entreat the favor of God, that he may be gracious unto us: this hath been by your means: will he accept any of your persons? saith Jehovah of hosts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh that there were one among you that would shut the doors, that ye might not kindle ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mine altar in vain! I have no pleasure in you, saith Jehovah of hosts, neither will I accept an offering at your hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For from the rising of the sun even unto the going down of the same my name ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " great among the Gentiles; and in every place incense ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " offered unto my name, and a pure offering: for my name ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " great among the Gentiles, saith Jehovah of hosts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ye profane it, in that ye say, The table of Jehovah is polluted, and the fruit thereof, even its food, is contemptible. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye say also, Behold, what a weariness is it! and ye have snuffed at it, saith Jehovah of hosts; and ye have brought that which was taken by violence, and the lame, and the sick; thus ye bring the offering: should I accept this at your hand? saith Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But cursed be the deceiver, who hath in his flock a male, and voweth, and sacrificeth unto the Lord a blemished thing; for I am a great King, saith Jehovah of hosts, and my name is terrible among the Gentiles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
